    "summary": "A segment of the Koryak-English vocabulary listing many lexical items, including pronouns, numerals, everyday actions, and nouns for world, mountain, woman/wife/daughter, herd, reindeer hunting, winter fish, smoke, fire, egg, sledge, and an evil spirit, with Chukchi cognates.",
    "language": "English",
